Package: gpcrit
Type: Package
Title: Gaussian Process Design Criteria (IMSE, MMSE, Entropy)
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 2026-07-28
Author: Wenje Ma
Maintainer: Wenje Ma <wenjema@example.com>
Description: Implements IMSE (Integrated Mean Squared Error),
    MMSE (Maximum Mean Squared Error), and entropy criteria
    for optimal experimental design under Gaussian process models
    with a Gaussian correlation function. Provides functions for
    computing RMSE, IMSE, MMSE, and entropy given a design and
    correlation length parameter theta. All functions assume a
    1D input space [0,1] and use the correlation function
    R(d) = exp(-(d/theta)^2).
License: GPL-3
Imports:
    stats
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: false
NeedsCompilation: no
